    summary: "OBI-902 is an antibody-drug conjugate from OBI Pharma, Inc aimed at TROP2, a protein on the surface of many solid tumours. Its one registered study (NCT07124117) is a phase 1/2 trial in advanced solid tumours: dose escalation, then expansion and randomised dose-finding cohorts, with 147 participants planned. It started in August 2025 and was listed as recruiting on ClinicalTrials.gov on 18 November 2026, with primary completion expected in February 2029. OBI Pharma says it holds rights outside mainland China, Hong Kong and Macau, where Biosion holds them. No results are posted, and whether it works in people has not been established.",
    targets: ["trop2"], cancers: ["metastatic-cancer"], companies: ["obi-pharma"], trials: ["nct07124117"],
